e private (no `#[no_mangle]`) since they are `static`/`static inline` in C and don't appear in `persym.txt`. Multiplications in the bit-gather/spread helpers use `wrapping_mul` to mirror C's unsigned overflow semantics. The `softaes_block_load/store/xor/and` inline helpers from `private/softaes.h` were not needed/translated since none of the exported functions in this `.c` file call them.\n\n**Build verification**: `cargo build --release --target-dir $W/_chk/softaes` produced errors only in `src/randombytes_sysrandom.rs` and `src/ed25519_ref10_fe.rs` (pre-existing, unrelated modules). `grep -n \"softaes\" build.log` returned zero matches — no errors or warnings attributable to `softaes.rs`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_read_input_tokens":114242,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":575,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01ET28gJnTHWPb7dxYnwifMy","session_id":"3f891fde-b339-4353-9d37-1cfde3da52f8","uuid":"e8d12298-fb79-44c4-8d35-ee88f7e9a375","timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:10:56.154Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Translate softaes"}
