{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":13279850,"num_turns":9,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3f891fde-b339-4353-9d37-1cfde3da52f8","total_cost_usd":50.181075900000025,"usage":{"input_tokens":18,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42365,"cache_read_input_tokens":3205109,"output_tokens":23389,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":775},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":42365},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"global.anthropic.claude-opus-5[1m]":{"inputTokens":188,"outputTokens":152321,"cacheReadInputTokens":18241783,"cacheCreationInputTokens":371310,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":15.250544000000001,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"bedrock","costBasis":"list"},"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":1774,"outputTokens":1197639,"cacheReadInputTokens":70620707,"cacheCreationInputTokens":3530581,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":34.930531900000005,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"bedrock","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"not_first_party","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"subagent_stats":{"spawned":35,"requested":{"background":35,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":35,"max_depth":1,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":35,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":2,"budget":0},"by_type":{"general-purpose":35}},"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"Done. The complete libsodium 1.0.23 library is translated to Rust.\n\n**Result — verified, not just compiling:**\n\n| Check | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `cargo build --release` (clean rebuild) | succeeds, 0 errors |\n| `nm -D` exported symbols: C `.so` vs Rust `.so` | **890 vs 890, diff empty** (no missing, no extra) |\n| Differential test phase 1 (537 lines of outputs) | **byte-identical** |\n| Differential test phase 2 (757 lines: error paths, edge cases, long inputs) | **byte-identical** |\n| `c_src/` modified | no |\n\n**Scope covered:** all 114 C files that contribute symbols (the 25 SIMD/asm variants compile to nothing under the reference `no HAVE_*` config, so their portable fallbacks are what's reproduced) → 60 Rust modules, ~27k lines, `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`, zero external dependencies (libc bound by hand since the sandbox has no crates.io access).\n\nIncludes the macro-renamed linker symbols from `private/quirks.h` (e.g. `blake2b_init` → `_sodium_blake2b_init`, `ge25519_p3_add` → `_sodium_ge25519_p3_add`, `argon2_ctx` → `_sodium_argon2_ctx`, `escrypt_r` → `_sodium_escrypt_r`) and the exported data objects (`aegis128l_soft_implementation`, `crypto_stream_chacha20_ref_implementation`, `randombytes_sysrandom_implementation`, …).\n\n**Bugs I found and fixed during verification** (both caught by the differential harness / symbol diff, not by trusting sub-agent self-reports):\n- `poly_ntt`/`poly_invntt` in ML-KEM-768: inner butterfly loop incremented by `len` instead of `1`, so most butterflies never ran — corrupted every ML-KEM and X-Wing output.\n- `ge25519_p2_dbl`: two self-aliasing `fe25519_sub` calls needed a temporary copy.\n\n**Reproduction tooling left in place:** `tools/cpp.sh` (shows the exact post-preprocessor C for any file), `tools/difftest.c`, `tools/difftest2.c`, `tools/rundiff.sh`, `CONVENTIONS.md`.\n\nOne caveat worth stating plainly: the two harnesses exercise every public primitive plus many error/edge paths, but they are not exhaustive — untested corners (unusual `sodium_misuse()` triggers, the guarded-heap paths that this build config compiles out, huge-input overflow guards) rest on line-by-line fidelity rather than measured equality.","ttft_ms":3639,"ttft_stream_ms":2974,"time_to_request_ms":13,"type":"result","duration_ms":242618,"uuid":"6f752149-331a-4923-88e7-73fe981cac03","queued_turn_count":0}
